MUSIC AND SOUND EFFECTS

The preset music, jingles and sound effects that come with Pocket-Game-Maker (the
music/ and sounds/ folders of the Asset Library, and the sample project) are
original works by project-tech-me <project-tech-me@protonmail.com>, composed
and synthesised from scratch for Pocket-Game-Maker (tools/gen-audio.js). They contain
no samples, loops or recordings from any other source.

They are dedicated to the public domain under Creative Commons Zero
(CC0 1.0 Universal): https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
You can use, change and include them in free or commercial games without asking
permission and without giving credit. Credit is appreciated but not required.

Music and jingles (MP3):
  music/title-dawn-of-adventure.mp3         Dawn of Adventure (title screen)
  music/town-sunny-town.mp3                 Sunny Town (towns and villages)
  music/route-open-road.mp3                 Open Road (routes and the overworld)
  music/cave-echoing-depths.mp3             Echoing Depths (caves and dungeons)
  music/battle-wild-clash.mp3               Wild Clash (wild monster battles)
  music/battle-rival-showdown.mp3           Rival Showdown (trainer battles)
  music/victory-fanfare.mp3                 Victory Fanfare (after winning a battle)
  music/jingle-rest-well.mp3                Rest Well (healing the party)
  music/jingle-found-it.mp3                 Found It! (getting an item)
  music/jingle-new-friend.mp3               New Friend (catching or receiving a monster)

Sound effects (MP3):
  sounds/cursor.mp3                         Cursor
  sounds/confirm.mp3                        Confirm
  sounds/cancel.mp3                         Cancel
  sounds/buzzer.mp3                         Buzzer
  sounds/hit.mp3                            Hit
  sounds/hit-strong.mp3                     Strong hit
  sounds/faint.mp3                          Faint
  sounds/throw.mp3                          Throw
  sounds/shake.mp3                          Ball shake
  sounds/catch.mp3                          Caught
  sounds/break-free.mp3                     Break free
  sounds/level-up.mp3                       Level up
  sounds/run-away.mp3                       Run away
  sounds/door.mp3                           Door
  sounds/bump.mp3                           Bump
  sounds/coin.mp3                           Coins
  sounds/heal.mp3                           Heal
  sounds/encounter.mp3                      Encounter
  sounds/save.mp3                           Save

Music or sounds you import yourself (MP3 or FLAC) stay under their own
licences. Record where they came from in Database > Credits.

